#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Syslog-opgraderingsadviseur"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Gradeer Syslog op van %s na %s? Bestaande boodskappe en reëls sal behoue bly. Skemaveranderings kan tyd neem."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Watter opgraderings-/installeringstipe wil jy gebruik"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Wanneer jy baie groot tabelle het, sal 'n Truncate (afkap) baie vinniger wees.  Indien jy bekommerd is oor argiefdata, kan jy óf Inlyn kies, wat jou blaaier vir die duur van hierdie opgradering sal vries, óf agtergrond, wat 'n agtergrondproses sal skep om jou ou syslog-data vanuit 'n rugsteuntabel na die nuwe syslog-formaat oor te dra.  Hierdie proses kan weer eens etlike ure duur.  'n Truncate gooi slegs die gestoorde syslog- en verwyderde boodskappe weg; waarskuwing-, verwydering- en verslagreëls word altyd behou."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Maak Syslog-tabel leeg"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Inlyn-opgradering"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Agtergrondopgradering"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Databasis-bergingenjin"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Die bergingsenjin vir die analitiese tabelle.  Slegs InnoDB- en, op MariaDB, Aria-bergingsenjins word ondersteun.  Enige Afgeleë Data-insamelaar-opsie vereis InnoDB; onversoenbare kombinasies kan nie ingedien word nie."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "InnoDB-berging"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Aria-berging"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Tydstempel-presisie"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Millisekonde-presisie stoor subsekonde Syslog-tydstempels in 'n TIMESTAMP(3)-kolom en is slegs op MariaDB beskikbaar.  Sekonde-presisie gebruik 'n standaard TIMESTAMP-kolom.  Op 'n produksiestelsel, gebruik cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms tydens 'n instandhoudingsvenster om bestaande boodskappe om te skakel sonder om dit weg te gooi."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Millisekonde - TIMESTAMP(3) (slegs MariaDB)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Sekonde - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Afgeleë boodskapverwerking"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Aktiveer boodskapverwerking vir afgeleë dataversamelaar"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Indien u Afgeleë Data-insamelaars hul eie Syslog-databasisse het en hul boodskappe onafhanklik verwerk, merk hierdie merkblokkie.  Deur hierdie merkblokkie te merk, sal u Afgeleë Data-insamelaars hul eie 'config_local.php'-lêer moet onderhou om Syslog in te lig om 'n onafhanklike databasis vir boodskapvertoning en -verwerking te gebruik.  Gebruik asseblief die sjabloonlêer 'config_local.php.dist' vir hierdie doel.  WAARSKUWING: Syslog-tabelle sal outomaties geskep word sodra hierdie opsie geaktiveer word."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Sinchronisering van afgeleë dataversamelaarreëls"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Indien u Afgeleë Data-insamelaars hul eie Syslog-databasisse het en hul boodskappe onafhanklik verwerk, merk hierdie merkblokkie indien u wil hê die Hoof-Cacti-databasis se Alarm-, Verwyderings- en Verslagreëls na die Afgeleë Cacti-stelsel gestuur moet word."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Stoor rekords op afgeleë versamelaar"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Behou verwerkte boodskappe in die afgeleë versamelaar se Syslog-tabel nadat dit aan die Hoofversamelaar afgelewer is. Wanneer dit gedeaktiveer is, word rekords slegs plaaslik behou terwyl die Hoofversamelaar onbeskikbaar is en word dit ná bevestigde herstelaflewering verwyder."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Behoudbeleid"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Kies hoeveel dae se Syslog-waardes jy in die databasis wil behou."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Partisioneringsvlak"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Die grootte van elke partisie van die syslog- en syslog_removed-tabelle.  Daagliks word aanbeveel.  Uurliks vereis 'n eindige retensie, en die retensie en partisioneringsvlak saam moet binne die databasisbediener se partisielimiet pas.  Om die vlak later te verander, verander dit in Instellings en voer cli/upgrade_partitioning.php uit."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Opgradeer"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Installeer"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Syslog %s-adviseur"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "WAARSKUWING: Syslog-opgradering neem baie tyd in beslag!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Die opgradering van die 'main' syslog-tabel kan 'n baie tydrowende proses wees. Daarom word dit aanbeveel dat u óf die grootte van u syslog-tabel voor die opgradering verklein, óf die agtergrondopsie kies."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Indien u die agtergrond-opsie kies, sal u ou syslog-tabel hernoem word en 'n nuwe syslog-tabel sal geskep word.  Daarna sal 'n opgraderingsproses in die agtergrond geloods word.  Weer eens, hierdie agtergrondproses kan 'n geruime tyd neem om te voltooi.  U data sal egter behoue bly."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Ongeag u keuse sal alle bestaande verwyderings- en waarskuwingsreëls tydens die opgraderingsproses behou word."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Druk <b>'Opgradeer'</b> om met die opgradering voort te gaan, of <b>'Kanselleer'</b> om na die Inproppe-kieslys terug te keer."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Jy kan ook die databasis-bergingenjin vir die analitiese tabelle syslog en syslog_remove stel.  Slegs die InnoDB-bergingenjin en, op MariaDB, die Aria-bergingenjin word ondersteun.  Indien jy MariaDB gebruik, beveel ons die Aria-bergingenjin aan wanneer geen afgeleë data-insamelaar-opsies geaktiveer is nie; insamelaaropsies vereis InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Jy het verskeie opsies om van te kies wanneer jy Syslog installeer. Die eerste is die Databasis-argitektuur. Gepartisioneerde tabelle is die enigste ondersteunde argitektuur aangesien dit voorkom dat die grootte van die tabelle oormatig word en navrae sodoende vertraag. Tradisionele nie-gepartisioneerde tabelle word afgekeur en word nie meer vir nuwe installasies aangebied nie."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Jy kan ook die tydstempelpresisie kies.  Millisekondepresisie (TIMESTAMP(3)) behou die subsekonde-volgorde van inkomende boodskappe en is slegs op MariaDB beskikbaar; MySQL-installasies gebruik sekonde-presisie.  Dit kan nie later in plek verander word sonder om die gestoorde boodskappe te vernietig nie."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Aria-berging is onbeskikbaar terwyl enige Afgeleë Dataversamelaar-opsie geaktiveer is. InnoDB is gekies."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Jy kan ook die retensieduur kies.  Hou asseblief in gedagte dat as jy verskeie gashere het wat na syslog aanteken, hierdie tabel redelik groot kan word."

