#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Algemene instellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog geaktiveer"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Indien hierdie merkblokkie gemerk is, sal rekords vanaf die Inkomende Syslog-tabel na die hoof-syslog-tabel oorgedra word en Alarms en Verslae sal geaktiveer word.  Hou asseblief in gedagte dat indien die stelsel gedeaktiveer is, logboekinskrywings steeds in die Inkomende Syslog-tabel sal ophoop aangesien dit deur die rsyslog- of syslog-ng-proses gedefinieer word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Stuur alarms aan na Alarmbestuurder"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Laat reëls wat op Alarmbestuurder gestel is toe om alarms aan te stuur. Syslog-E-pos bly die terugvalopsie; opdragaksies loop slegs vir Syslog-alarmeringsreëls."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Stroop domeine"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "'n Kommageskeide lys van domeine wat jy uit die Syslog-gasheernaam wil verwyder, voorbeelde is 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Verfrisinterval"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Dit is die tyd in sekondes voordat die bladsy verfris."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Slaan totale rytelling oor"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Indien hierdie merkblokkie gemerk is, tel die Stelsellogs- en Alarmlogs-oortjies nie elke ooreenstemmende rekord nie, wat baie hulpbronintensief op groot installasies kan wees. Die bladsy wys Vorige- en Volgende-skakels in plaas van 'n totaal en bladsylys, en Volgende word aangebied terwyl daar nog rekords oor is."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Maks. verslagrekords"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Vir Drempel-gebaseerde waarskuwings, wat is die maksimum aantal wat u in die verslag wil wys. Dit word gebruik om die grootte van die HTML-logboek en E-pos te beperk."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "%d Rekords"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Maksimum Syslog-verwerkingsprosesse"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Wanneer dit hoër as 1 gestel word, word die verwerking van inkomende boodskappe oor parallelle werkerprosesse versprei.  Elke werker hanteer 'n afsonderlike reeks inkomende boodskappe, wat gasheernaamoplossing en boodskapoordrag onder swaar ladings versnel.  'n Instelling van 1 verwerk alle boodskappe in 'n enkele proses.  Werkerprosesse word nie op Windows ondersteun nie of wanneer die PHP pcntl- en POSIX-uitbreidings nie beskikbaar is nie, in welke geval verwerking na 'n enkele proses terugval."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "%d Werkerproses"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "%d Werkerprosesse"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Opdrag vir die oopmaak van kaartjies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Hierdie opdrag sal uitgevoer word om Hulptoonbank-kaartjies oop te maak. Die opdrag sal verskeie invoerparameters soos volg moet ontleed: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Die hostlist sal 'n komma-geskeide lys wees van gashere wat deur die waarskuwing geraak word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Gasheerontdekkingsopsies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Aktiveer gasheernaamomsetting"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Indien hierdie merkblokkie gemerk is, word alle gasheername eerste via DNS-opsoeking opgelos (indien geaktiveer), met gebruik van A- en AAAA-rekords. IPv4- en IPv6-adresse benodig geen opsoeking nie, en IPv6-adresse word in saamgeperste kleinlettervorm gestoor. Indien die DNS-opsoeking misluk, sal die stelsel probeer om die gasheernaam teen die Cacti-gasheertabel op te los en dit met die Cacti-gasheerbeskrywing te vervang. Indien beide DNS- en Cacti-opsoekings misluk, word die voorvoegsel 'unresolved-Original_hostname' aan rekords toegeken."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Slaan DNS-oplossing vir inkomende gashere oor"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Indien hierdie merkblokkie gemerk is, sal die stelsel nie probeer om gashere via DNS-opsoekings op te los nie.  Dit is nuttig vir omgewings waar DNS-oplossing nie moontlik of nie gewens is nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "HTML-kennisgewinginstellings"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Aktiveer HTML-gebaseerde e-pos"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Indien hierdie merkblokkie gemerk is, sal alle E-posse in HTML-formaat gestuur word.  Andersins sal E-posse in skoon teks gestuur word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Formaatlêer om te gebruik"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Kies die pasgemaakte HTML-omhulsel en CSS-lêer om te gebruik. Hierdie lêer bevat beide HTML en CSS om rondom u verslag te draai. As dit meer as net CSS bevat, moet u 'n spesiale <REPORT>-merker binne die lêer plaas. Hierdie formaatmerker sal deur die verslaginhoud vervang word. Hierdie lêers is in die 'formats'-gids geleë."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Databewaring en partisionering"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Syslog-bewaring"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Dit is die aantal dae om gebeurtenisse te behou."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Die grootte van elke partisie van die syslog- en syslog_removed-tabelle. 'n Verandering word hier gestoor, maar tree eers in werking wanneer cli/upgrade_partitioning.php beide tabelle herbou; tot dan behou partisie-instandhouding die bestaande grootte. Uurlikse partisionering vereis 'n eindige retensie. Die retensie, voorafskeppingvenster en partisioneringsvlak saam moet binne die databasisbediener se partisielimiet pas, anders word die instellings nie gestoor nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Venster vir voorafskepping van partisies"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Dit is die aantal dae van toekomstige partisies om vir gepartisioneerde Syslog-tabelle in stand te hou, sodat nuwe partisies altyd vanaf 'n leë dMaxValue-partisie gesplits word. Uurlikse partisionering behou altyd ten minste 2 dae."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "%d dag"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "%d dae"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Partisieherwinningslimiet"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Wanneer partisies ontbreek (byvoorbeeld ná onderhoudsonderbreking), word hoogstens soveel ontbrekende partisies per tabel tydens elke poller-lopie geskep.  Die oorblywende gaping word oor daaropvolgende lopies herstel; retensiesnoei bly uitgestel totdat die toekomstige partisiehorison ten volle herstel is.  Slegs van toepassing op gepartisioneerde Syslog-tabelle."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "%d partisie per lopie"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "%d partisies per lopie"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Versamelaar-verouderingsdrempel"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Pyplyngesondheid-alarms waarsku wanneer onverwerkte boodskappe, verwerkingsvoltooiing of sinchronisasie in die tou hierdie vertraging oorskry. Die effektiewe vertraging is ten minste drie poller-intervalle en 300 sekondes. Stel op 0 om 300 sekondes te gebruik."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Verstek (300 sekondes)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "%d sekondes"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Versamelaar-agterstanddrempel"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Die Syslog Status-bladsy wys 'n Waarskuwing wanneer meer as hierdie aantal boodskappe onverwerk in die Syslog Incoming-tabel sit. Stel op 0 om die verstekwaarde van 10000 boodskappe te gebruik."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Verstek (10000 boodskappe)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "%d boodskappe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Pyplyn-gesondheidsalarms"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Kennisgewinglys vir pyplyngesondheid"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Kies 'n bestaande Thold-kennisgewinglys vir pyplyngesondheidsalarms. Geaktiveerde lysontvangers word gekombineer met die e-posadresse hieronder, terwyl BCC-ontvangers behou word. Lyste vereis die Thold-kennisgewinglystabel."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "E-posontvangers vir pyplyngesondheid"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Kommageskeide e-posontvangers vir pyplynfoute en -herstel. Laat leeg en kies geen kennisgewinglys om e-pos te deaktiveer; gesondheid bly sigbaar op die Status-oortjie en statusveranderings word aangeteken. Kontroles vereis dat die Cacti-poller loop."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Herinneringsinterval vir pyplyngesondheid"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Herhaal kennisgewings vir voortdurende pyplynprobleme na hierdie interval. Mislukte e-pospogings word nie meer as een keer elke vyf minute weer probeer nie."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Syslog-waarskuwingsbewaring"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Dit is die aantal dae om alarmlogboeke te behou."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Alarmonderdrukking en instandhouding"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Onderhoudvenster-dae"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Dae waarop alle waarskuwingskennisgewings gedurende die opgestelde onderhoudstydperk gedemp word."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Onderhoudvenster begin"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Plaaslike begintyd vir die globale instandhoudingsvenster."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Onderhoudvenster eindig"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Plaaslike eindtyd vir die globale instandhoudingsvenster. 'n Vroeër eindtyd duur voort tot die volgende dag."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Eenmalige instandhouding begin"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Opsionele plaaslike datum en tyd om 'n eenmalige globale instandhoudingsvenster te begin."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Eenmalige instandhouding eindig"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Opsionele plaaslike datum en tyd om 'n eenmalige globale instandhoudingsvenster te beëindig. Formaat: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Verstek-waarskuwingsafkoeltyd"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Onderdruk enige herhaalde kennisgewing vir dieselfde reël en verslagdoeningsbestek vir soveel minute. Per-reëlwaardes oorheers hierdie instelling. Stel op 0 om te deaktiveer."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
