msgid "Email Body Text"
msgstr "E-posinhoudteks"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "This information will appear in the body of the Alert just before the Alert details."
msgstr "Hierdie inligting sal in die liggaam van die Waarskuwing net voor die Waarskuwing-besonderhede verskyn."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Open Ticket"
msgstr "Maak kaartjie oop"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Should a Help Desk Ticket be opened for this Alert.  NOTE: The Ticket command script will be populated with several 'ALERT_' environment variables for convenience."
msgstr "Moet 'n hulptoonbank-kaartjie vir hierdie alarm oopgemaak word.  LET WEL: Die kaartjie-opdragskrip sal geriefshalwe met verskeie 'ALERT_'-omgewingsveranderlikes gevul word."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Alert command"
msgstr "Alarmopdrag"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Wanneer 'n waarskuwing geaktiveer word, voer die volgende opdrag uit.  Die volgende vervangingsveranderlikes is beskikbaar: <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Neem asseblief kennis dat <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> slegs op individuele drempels beskikbaar is.  Hierdie vervangingswaardes kan op die opdragreël verskyn, of uit die omgewing van die skrip verkry word.  Wanneer dit vanuit die omgewing gebruik word, sal daardie veranderlikes met 'ALERT_' voorafgegaan word."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Herstelopdrag"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Opsionele opdrag om uit te voer wanneer hierdie drempel herstel ná sy stilteperiode. Gebruik dieselfde vervangingsveranderlikes as die Waarskuwingsopdrag. SYSLOG_EVENT is 'clear'; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID stem ooreen met die oortredingsopdrag. Mislukte opdragte word weer probeer. Laat leeg om te deaktiveer."

